The section must do:
- Shows the rules of the game: a secret whole number between 1 and the highest number is chosen, the player types guesses, and after each guess the app says whether the secret is higher or lower, until the player finds it or runs out of guesses.

The person sets these on the screen and nothing else uses them yet; the section uses them:
